**Indian home-kitchen substitutions:** Paneer directly replaces tofu/chicken in chilli and manchurian dishes (the default for veg families). Readymade Ching's Schezwan chutney, soy, green-chilli and red-chilli sauces are pantry staples. For gluten-free, swap regular soy sauce for **tamari** and use rice noodles; most Indian soy sauce contains wheat. Egg is optional in soups and noodles — omit for vegan.

